      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## P-H3 Text2Image\nWrite a request on P-H3 Prompt Writer, choose an aspect ratio and 4 or 8 MP, and queue.\nThe writer's prompt, width and height are wired to p-h3-image Conditioning.\n\nRequires ComfyUI 0.44.0 or newer. The upsampler and image text encoder are separate models; both Load CLIP nodes use type minimax.\n\nUse the eight-step sigmas shown here, ER SDE, BasicGuider (no CFG), and shifts 1.0/1.0. Models: https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy\n\nPrompt library: run once, then save or edit the result. repeat_last reuses text with the current pictures and canvas. bypass passes the request through without rewriting."
      ]
    }
